OL,3,GNEWSAPeople forced from homes during
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of people have been forced to
OL,7,Fleave their homes following a report of
OL,8,Fa suspicious object.
OL,10,FPolice are currently at the scene in
OL,11,Feast Belfast where some residents have
OL,12,Fbeen evacuated in Victor Place.
OL,14,FMotorists have been advised to avoid
OL,15,Fthe area.
OL,17,FMore to follow.
